# API service (`apps/api`)

- FastAPI + SQLAlchemy 2.x async patterns already in-repo
- Thin routes; orchestration in services; real Postgres in tests
- `pytest` with warnings treated seriously; use `ruff` + `mypy` gates
- Do not invent endpoints that break OpenAPI contracts silently
- Idempotent mutations where retries are expected
